//- OLD-DISCORD "VIEWING OLDER MESSAGES" BAR - FLOATS OVER THE BOTTOM OF THE
//- MESSAGE AREA WHILE THE VIEW IS TIME-TRAVELLING (ANCHORED WINDOW). EMPTY
//- IN LIVE MODE (:empty COLLAPSES IT), AND ALWAYS OOB-ADDRESSABLE SO ANY
//- RESPONSE OR WS PUSH CAN FLIP IT: LIVE MESSAGES PUSH THE "New messages"
//- PILL, THE CATCH-UP/JUMP RESPONSES CLEAR IT.
.jumpToPresentBar#jumpToPresent(
  hx-select-oob="#jumpToPresent"
  hx-swap-oob="outerHTML"
)
  if anchored
    span.jumpBarText You're viewing older messages
    if hasNew
      span.jumpBarNewPill New messages
    button.jumpBarButton(
      type="button"
      hx-post="/chat/jump-to-present"
      hx-swap="none"
    ) Jump To Present
